<title>USA: Ford September U.S. car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Ford September U.S. car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   143,130	   136,689	     +9.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 156,888	   152,743	     +7.0</p>
<p> Import Car		 1,578	     3,263	    -49.6</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	 1,320,542	 1,340,671	     -1.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,566,601	 1,528,750	     +2.0</p>
<p> Import Car		31,722	    50,065	    -36.9</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
